      "content": "Wix REST API provides programmatic access to Wix business solutions including\ne-commerce (carts, checkouts, orders, products), site services, and OAuth 2.0\nauthentication. Apps authenticate via OAuth on behalf of Wix users, site visitors,\nor members.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Wix",
